"parent":null,"inputs":{"MESSAGE":[1,[10,"SCRIPT!!!!!!!!!!!"]]},"fields":{},"shadow":false,"topLevel":true,"x":56,"y":195,"comment":"XV(2q{Nt@9Z~t?jCjX_p"},"jcnpVK,P{KJyf.Fd~--D":{"opcode":"event_whenflagclicked","next":"IAL`GeCcH1i%_:MeV:[c","parent":null,"inputs":{},"fields":{},"shadow":false,"topLevel":true,"x":7,"y":319},"IAL`GeCcH1i%_:MeV:[c":{"opcode":"looks_hide","next":null,"parent":"jcnpVK,P{KJyf.Fd~--D","inputs":{},"fields":{},"shadow":false,"topLevel":false}},"comments":{"BMW`t7gh(6HH0W_}*|~*":{"blockId":"j3WaZmKaU^l/MlgK`n9^","x":398.8888905843099,"y":194.51851851851865,"width":200,"height":200,"minimized":false,"text":""},"XV(2q{Nt@9Z~t?jCjX_p":{"blockId":"V=|zj,]C+?%u!mKb^L+)","x":255.27983539094652,"y":154.6460905349794,"width":809.4815673828125,"height":1353.2962646484375,"minimized":false,"text":"Script:\n\nIntro: Make sure it says High Hopes a completed Lion, Holly, Jay MAP hosted by @fly_high120. For the Background could it please be like a forest. Or at least make sure it has some trees.\n\nIntro 2: Have Lionblaze, Holly leaf and Jayfeather running. It could just show their legs if that's easier. In the forest or by the lake. Daytime/ forest or lake\n\n1: Show Lionblaze, Holly leaf and Jayfeather as kits in the snow. When it says shoot for the Stars have them look up or have the scene change to a sky. Daytime/ Snow and sky\n\n2: Show Lionblaze, Holly leaf, and Jayfeather as kits in the snow with Leafpool and Squirrelflight. Maybe have them playing or have the kits running around. Daytime/ Snowy forest\n\n3: Make it kind of a flash of the future So everything is white, gray, or black. Show Lionblaze getting scratched but not harmed, Jayfeather with a stick, and Hollyleaf by a tunnel. Make sure its in those colors. any time\n\n4: Show Squirrelflight talking to Lionblaze, Hollyleaf, and Jayfeather as apprentices in the Thunder clan camp. Daytime/ Thunderclan camp\n\n5: Show Firestar standing on the high ledge in the Thunder clan camp and then show Lionblaze looking up at him. Nighttime/ Thunderclan camp highledge\n\n6: When it says \"mama said\" show Leaf pool. Then when it says \"rewrite your history\" show Jayfeather talking with Yellow fang as a star clan cat. Background is Black. Daytime/ med den\n\n7: Show Leaf pool and Squirrelflight talking and Have Lionblaze, Hollyleaf and Jayfeather looking at them. Background is in the forest. Nighttime/ forest\n\n8: When is says \"Had to have High High Hopes for a living\" show Lionblaze jumping over anything with a determind look on his face. Then show him catching a mouse or bird or any type of animal that is small. Daytime/ forest\n\n9: Show Jayfeather in the Medicine Cat Den sniffing or sorting herbs with a sad face. Then he looks up and sees a star clan cat. (just a ghost figure no specific cat.) Daytime/ Med den\n\n10: Show Hollyleaf talking with Firestar somewhere in the Thunderclan Camp. Nightime\n\n11: Show Lionblaze talking with Ashfur in the forest. Daytime\n\n12: At the beginning, show Jayfeather studying his Stick. Then when it says \"Stay up on that rise\" show Firestar talking to Brambleclaw on the High ledge. Daytime\n\n13: Show Hollyleaf running through the forest. Nightime\n\n14: Show Lionblaze, Jayfeather and Hollyleaf talking with Sol. Background is by the Lake. Nightime/ Lake\n\n15: Show Jayfeather talking with Brambleclaw in the Thunderclan camp. Nightime/ Thunderclan camp\n\n16: Show Ashfur in some flames being yelled at by Squirrelflight. Lionblaze, Hollyleaf and Jayfeather are watching in disbelief. Nightime\n\n17: Show Hollyleaf and Ashfur sitting next to each other but not touching. Then when it says \"Couldn't make a killing\" Hollyleaf pushes Ashfur into the stream. Nightime\n\n18: Show Hollyleaf running up to Lionblaze and Jayfeather with her head low. Then when it gets more upbeat have her brothers turn around to look at her. Nighttime/ forest\n\n19: Jayfeather is at the Moon pool dreaming.\n\n20: Show Leaf pool looking at Lionblaze, Jayfeather and Hollyleaf, and they are looking back with a mad expression. Daytime/ Thunderclan camp\n\n21: Show Lionblaze, Hollyleaf and Jayfeather running in the forest. Daytime\n\n22: Hollyleaf runs into a tunnel and the entrance falls and she's trapped. Her brothers are outside staring in shock.\n\n23: Show Lionblaze, Jayfeather, and Hollyleaf sitting next to each other with a determined expression on their faces."}},"currentCostume":0,"costumes":[{"name":"Lionblaze","bitmapResolution":2,"dataFormat":"png","assetId":"c0daba335ad5d344eefaf903ac37e392","md5ext":"c0daba335ad5d344eefaf903ac37e392.png","rotationCenterX":395,"rotationCenterY":218},{"name":"Jayfeather","bitmapResolution":2,"dataFormat":"png","assetId":"102de46659ccab77e4dc8d2d6ae65571","md5ext":"102de46659ccab77e4dc8d2d6ae65571.png","rotationCenterX":440,"rotationCenterY":218},{"name":"Hollyleaf","bitmapResolution":2,"dataFormat":"png","assetId":"9500512a842f3aba2e8504f1906e13c5","md5ext":"9500512a842f3aba2e8504f1906e13c5.png","rotationCenterX":350,"rotationCenterY":218},{"name":"Squirrelflight","bitmapResolution":2,"dataFormat":"png","assetId":"b92a78ab6291f6bbf724883a780ac5b4","md5ext":"b92a78ab6291f6bbf724883a780ac5b4.png","rotationCenterX":362,"rotationCenterY":218},{"name":"Leafpool","bitmapResolution":2,"dataFormat":"png","assetId":"d2a54e85024f81b8f0ba70f39385573d","md5ext":"d2a54e85024f81b8f0ba70f39385573d.png","rotationCenterX":310,"rotationCenterY":218},{"name":"Brambleclaw","bitmapResolution":2,"dataFormat":"png","assetId":"abca11253b2232d45189ebeebc85e587","md5ext":"abca11253b2232d45189ebeebc85e587.png","rotationCenterX":373,"rotationCenterY":218},{"name":"Firestar","bitmapResolution":2,"dataFormat":"png","assetId":"79c9f146be0f9a2c7c91b725c4f8d7b0","md5ext":"79c9f146be0f9a2c7c91b725c4f8d7b0.png","rotationCenterX":335,"rotationCenterY":218},{"name":"Ashfur","bitmapResolution":2,"dataFormat":"png","assetId":"88c86127af8f15bdfb38c659417d8768","md5ext":"88c86127af8f15bdfb38c659417d8768.png","ro